      "cooked": "<p>Fanatic vs the Organization.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-252-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-93\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-252-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-93\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-252-writers-room-mystery-comics-vol-2-93\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #252 - Writer's Room: Mystery Comics Vol. 2 #93</a></h3>\n\n  <p>It's gritty time!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:30:13 We start with some goofs and chats, and then we get right into it, telling a story designed to make you feel good about the world and humanity! All is well!  A note on that brilliant cover that...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2ae289296b8420befe4e2018d43ea93f36ca09cc.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/2ae289296b8420befe4e2018d43ea93f36ca09cc\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2ae289296b8420befe4e2018d43ea93f36ca09cc_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"67np4H000bAIu1F3ySKcEgR3rOc\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2ae289296b8420befe4e2018d43ea93f36ca09cc_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2ae289296b8420b