      "created_at": "2023-06-14T00:25:51.075Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Cover’s a lovely emulation of the Sin City look, although it’d be more than ten years till he adopted that style and his 1984 work (notably Ronin) was much less polished, especially when he was doing his own inking.  Guess “Diller” was ahead of his IRL inspiration in terms of talent.</p>",
